{
  "_id": "aZHyWcCEV5j3viPD",
  "name": "王座之旨胡帕克杖 Hoopak of Throne's Command (BMT)",
  "type": "weapon",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "39",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>武器（胡帕克杖），極珍稀（需同調）</em><br />這把武器嵌有華麗的金絲，飾以深藍色和栗色的珠寶。你使用該武器進行的攻擊檢定和傷害擲骰獲得+1加值。此外，你獲得威嚇&amp;Reference[skill=Intimidation]和遊說&amp;Reference[skill=Persuasion]兩個技能中你沒有熟練項技能的熟練。<br /><em><strong>施法Spellcasting。 </strong></em>該武器有5發充能。你可以用一個附贈動作並花費1發或多發充能來施展以下法術之一（豁免 DC 16）： <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.Ja6HpsLeGA9MQ0Rm]{命令術 Command}</em>（1充能）、 <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.T4zFq0zTHnzZeO9t]{誠實之域 Zone of Truth}</em>（2充能）、 <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.RpBbOYseLZCFXaFY]{強迫術 Compulsion}</em>（4 充能）、<em> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.lopw7wVkPoE7gbNu]{放逐術 Banishment}</em>（4充能）、<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.JudswpO6E5GBlyfQ]{支配人類 Dominate Person}</em>（5充能）。</p><p>該武器每天在黎明時恢復[[/r 1d4]]發已消耗的充能。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">胡帕克杖是一根結實的棍子，一端掛有投石索的結構，另一端被削成尖頭。</span></p><p><em><strong>特殊Special。</strong></em><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">當你使用這種武器發動近戰攻擊時，你忽略其彈藥詞條。你同樣可以將胡帕克杖當做一把軍用遠程武器使用。這樣做時，此次攻擊使用其彈藥詞條（用投石索子彈作爲彈藥），在命中時造成</span>[[/damage 1d4 type=bludgeoning]]<span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">傷害。</span></p><p>This weapon is bedecked in ornate gold filigree and deep-blue and maroon jewels. You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this weapon. Additionally, you gain proficiency in the &amp;Reference[skill=Intimidation] and &amp;Reference[skill=Persuasion] skills if you don't already have it.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Spellcasting\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Spellcasting.</span> The weapon has 5 charges. You can use a bonus action and expend 1 or more of its charges to cast one of the following spells (save DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">16</span>): @spell[Command] (1 charge), @spell[Zone of Truth] (2 charges), @spell[Compulsion] (4 charges), @spell[Banishment] (4 charges), or @spell[Dominate Person] (5 charges).</p><p>The weapon regains [[/r 1d4]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p></div><p>A hoopak is a sturdy stick with a sling at one end and a pointed tip at the other.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Special\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Special.</span> When you make a melee attack with this weapon, you ignore its ammunition property. You can use the hoopak as a martial ranged weapon. If you do, it uses the ammunition property, uses sling bullets, and deals [[/damage 1d4 type=bludgeoning]] damage on a hit.</p></div></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
